  "shortDescription": "Compare invoices, purchase orders and receipts; route discrepancies for review.",
  "longDescription": "An accounts-payable matching workspace: invoice intake, three-way match against purchase orders and receipts, variance detection, discrepancy triage, approval routing, supplier context and an admin panel for audit, imports, integrations and data quality.",
